          "text": "Témoignages: TOUTLEMONDE (49) 31.10.2017",
          "text_sha256": "e7cda6a80db9099e6a18ea4835574f785397b28e5e38f5ed73dd12192115abc2"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
